"},{"number":252,"title":"extract_pages_markdown_bytes() flags every page as needs_ocr on a plain text-based PDF, contradicting detect_pdf_bytes()","comments":0,"created_at":"2026-08-04T13:26:20Z"},{"number":212,"title":"Arabic (RTL) text is returned in visual order, not logical order","comments":9,"created_at":"2026-08-02T13:49:52Z"},{"number":286,"title":"Valid PDF rejected as `malformed document: invalid PDF structure` when more than 506 trailing bytes follow `%%EOF`","comments":0,"created_at":"2026-08-06T18:15:46Z"},{"number":270,"title":"Ruled table splits into multiple tables when a single cell wraps to more than one line","comments":2,"created_at":"2026-08-05T14:32:22Z"},{"number":220,"title":"Feature: distinct-n self-check to catch duplicated output (well-encoded but repeated text)","comments":2,"created_at":"2026-08-02T14:47:51Z"},{"number":290,"title":"Making V2RAY Proxies","comments":0,"created_at":"2026-08-06T20:16:35Z"},{"number":276,"title":"Scanned/ImageBased page_signals empty case untested","comments":1,"created_at":"2026-08-05T23:25:01Z"}],"discussions":[{"number":472,"title":"lazy evaluation","comments":0,"category":"Q&A","created_at":"2026-08-30T15:31:15Z"}],"latest_release":{"name":"1.25.2 — Script sizes and ToUnicode repair checks","tag":"v1.25.2","published_at":"2026-09-28T07:14:32Z","body":"Changes since 1.25.1:\n\n- Size a super- or subscript run by its letters and digits: an exponent whose minus sign a symbol font sets a design size above its digits (as TeX does) keeps its `<sup>` markup; a run of signs alone, or with signs more than a quarter larger than its letters and digits, is still sized by its largest glyph (#603).\n- Skip a subset font's ToUnicode repairs where the font itself shows the CMap is right: the repair through a `/CIDToGIDMap` for a CMap keyed by code, and the renumbering of a subset that kept its glyph indexes (#605).\n\nNo API changes.\n\nRelease preparation: #606.\n\n[Full changelog](https://github.com/firecrawl/pdf-inspector/compare/v1.25.1...v1.25.2)\n","is_prerelease":false},"readme":true,"readme_zh":false,"news":[{"title":"Pdf-inspector: Rust lib for PDF inspection, classification, and text extraction","url":"https://github.com/firecrawl/pdf-inspector","hn":"https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=49143467","source":"Hacker News","lang":"en","date":"2026-08-02","points":5,"comments":1},{"title":"Fast Rust Library for PDF text extraction","url":"https://github.com/firecrawl/pdf-inspector","hn":"https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=49131615","source":"Hacker News","lang":"en","date":"2026-08-01","points":5,"comments":0},{"title":"GitHub开源项目静态工程审阅：用Valhalla思维解析pdf-inspector源码","url":"https://blog.csdn.net/weixin_28836507/article/details/166033302","source":"blog.csdn","lang":"zh","date":"2026-09-19"},{"title":"Githubトレンド on X: \"9/2 19:28 JST｜GitHub Trendingから2件：pdf-inspector / patent-disclosure-skill。中身はスレッドで紹介します。\"","url":"https://x.com/github_trendjp/status/2095096705649868927","source":"x","lang":"zh","date":"2026-09-02"},{"title":"GitHub每日热评｜Valhalla 静态工程审阅 ｜pdf-inspector 源码证据驱动评测","url":"https://blog.csdn.net/TunerT_TQ/article/details/163636105","source":"blog.csdn","lang":"zh","date":"2026-08-09"},{"title":"What is pdf-inspector? An Engineer's Guide to a PDF Parsing Library That Reduces RAG Costs","url":"https://note.com/obataka123/n/nea4a09f68a6c?hl=en","source":"note","lang":"en","date":"2026-08-03"},{"title":"pdf-inspectorとは？RAGのコストを削減するPDF解析ライブラリの使い方をエンジニア向けに解説","url":"https://note.com/obataka123/n/nea4a09f68a6c","source":"note","lang":"zh","date":"2026-08-03"},{"title":"How To Edit PDF Metadata Tags On Linux Using A GUI Or Command Line","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiiAFBVV95cUxPdFhiR1pfSEFiTFJ2N0ZoVmMtUERYTVJ2dEpzTkZZUC1ZT1o5cG5CRWlJb19MN1ZfNVlGZjYwdEtuX0ZkV0ZTclNqS3F0bVFzNFdHZzFOaUY2bGoyZk9kQ2dlRFlIWFEwa2hYZzVqNGQ3R3lFdjk4bE9Ba3FncG85b3hSQW1WSm9K?oc=5","source":"www.linuxuprising.com","lang":"en","date":"2021-01-25"}],"stale":false,"snapshot_at":"2026